Description: Unified App Store and Ecosystem Center for Pulsar OS.
 Discover, install, and manage Flatpak apps, native Debian packages,
 GNOME Shell extensions, and Sayri AI ecosystem plugins and skills.
 Includes a command line tool (pulsar-storectl) and a background
 update checker.
